---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Documentation - Kindly"
  description="Language and standard library reference for Kindly and Simple."
>
  <h1>Documentation</h1>
  <p>
    Kindly and Simple share a runtime and standard library. Their statement syntax differs;
    expressions, collection types, and function behavior are shared.
  </p>
  <section aria-labelledby="references">
    <h2 id="references">Reference</h2>
    <div>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th scope="col">Documentation</th><th scope="col">Contents</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row"><a href="/docs/kindly">Kindly</a></th>
            <td>Program structure, variables, functions, conditions, and loops.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row"><a href="/docs/simple">Simple</a></th>
            <td>Declarations, assignment, control flow, and functions in conventional syntax.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row"><a href="/docs/standard-library">Standard library</a></th>
            <td>Built-in functions, signatures, return values, and Simple examples.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
